This license does not claim control over independently developed software
merely because it has similar ideas, concepts, functions, or business models.
It grants no trademark rights and no permission to access, test, modify,
or disclose systems, accounts, or data without appropriate authorization.
Ownership is not transferred. Rights not expressly granted are reserved.

AKC assists with producing, preserving, displaying, and checking test results.
A check's PASS or evidence MATCH does not establish overall conformity,
formal acceptance, an independent security audit, unforgeable evidence, or
independent witnessing. Users and product owners retain their applicable
rights and responsibilities for scope, data, acceptance, and final decisions.

